{"id":"a83a239aef6bae71","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-omega-solovay-complete.md","title":"Omega and Solovay Completeness","display":"thm-omega-solovay-complete — Omega and Solovay Completeness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-omega-solovay-complete","aliases":["43-thm-omega-solovay-complete"],"display":"thm-omega-solovay-complete — Omega and Solovay Completeness","depends_on":["[[43-df-omega]]","[[43-df-solovay-red]]","[[43-df-solovay-complete]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Lemma 13.3.1, Theorem 13.3.4, Corollary 13.3.5","source_printed_pages":"343–345","source_pdf_pages":"363–365","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-omega-solovay-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-omega-solovay-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-solovay-complete — Omega and Solovay Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e51855b95e81cff\" href=\"?note=2e51855b95e81cff\" title=\"43-df-omega\">43-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6dd9273bb929547\" href=\"?note=a6dd9273bb929547\" title=\"43-df-solovay-complete\">43-df-solovay-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f5078ab697e20add\" href=\"?note=f5078ab697e20add\" title=\"43-df-universal-prefix-machine\">43-df-universal-prefix-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 13.3.1, Theorem 13.3.4, Corollary 13.3.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"343–345"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"363–365"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in(0,1)\">\\(\\alpha\\in(0,1)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\">\\(\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\ge N\\;X(n)=0\">\\(\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\ge N\\;X(n)=0\\)</span>；各谓词见直接依赖。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a> 的同名符号。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a6dd9273bb929547\" href=\"?note=a6dd9273bb929547\" title=\"43-df-solovay-complete\">43-df-solovay-complete</a> 的同名符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\Omega_U),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\Omega_U),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow(\\alpha\\le_S\\Omega_U\\land\\Omega_U\\le_S\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow(\\alpha\\le_S\\Omega_U\\land\\Omega_U\\le_S\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的通用性前提；原文件只出现未约束的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U\">\\(\\Omega_U\\)</span>。显式给出 Omega 的最高 Solovay 度性质。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Lemma 13.3.1, Theorem 13.3.4, Corollary 13.3.5；印刷页 343–345，PDF 页 363–365。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"2e51855b95e81cff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":